*   [Assert.AreNotEqual](/en-us/dotnet/api/microsoft.visualstudio.testtools.unittesting.assert.arenotequal)
*   [Assert.AreNotSame](/en-us/dotnet/api/microsoft.visualstudio.testtools.unittesting.assert.arenotsame)
*   [Assert.AreSame](/en-us/dotnet/api/microsoft.visualstudio.testtools.unittesting.assert.aresame)
*   [Assert.Contains](/en-us/dotnet/api/microsoft.visualstudio.testtools.unittesting.assert.contains)
